<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Utensil Theories - Book 2: Education & Study (Printable MS Word Document)</title>
  <!--[if gte mso 9]>
  <xml>
    <w:WordDocument>
      <w:View>Print</w:View>
      <w:Zoom>100</w:Zoom>
      <w:DoNotOptimizeForBrowser/>
    </w:WordDocument>
  </xml>
  <![endif]-->
  <style>
    @page Section1 {
      size: 11.0in 8.5in;
      mso-page-orientation: landscape;
      margin: 0.5in 0.5in 0.5in 0.5in;
      mso-header-margin: 0.5in;
      mso-footer-margin: 0.5in;
      mso-paper-source: 0;
    }
    div.Section1 { page: Section1; }
    
    body {
      font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11pt;
      color: #111827;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    h1 { font-family: 'Georgia', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 26pt; color: #7B3F00; margin-bottom: 4pt; }
    h2 { font-family: 'Calibri', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: #D47A00; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1pt; }
    h3 { font-size: 12pt; color: #111827; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 4pt; }

    .category-banner {
      background-color: #7B3F00;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 11pt;
      padding: 6pt 12pt;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2pt;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .prompt-box {
      background-color: #FFFBE6;
      border: 1.5pt solid #FDE68A;
      padding: 8pt 12pt;
      font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;
      font-size: 9.5pt;
      color: #0F172A;
      margin-top: 6pt;
      margin-bottom: 12pt;
    }

    .zine-grid {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-top: 12pt;
    }

    .zine-grid td {
      width: 25%;
      height: 2.8in;
      border: 1pt dashed #94A3B8;
      padding: 8pt;
      vertical-align: top;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .cover-cell {
      background-color: #7B3F00;
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .page-tag {
      font-family: 'Consolas', monospace;
      font-size: 8pt;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #64748B;
      border-bottom: 1pt solid #E2E8F0;
      padding-bottom: 2pt;
      margin-bottom: 4pt;
    }

    .cut-line {
      text-align: center;
      color: #DC2626;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-family: 'Consolas', monospace;
      font-size: 9pt;
      padding: 4pt 0;
      border-top: 2pt dashed #DC2626;
      margin: 8pt 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="Section1">

  <!-- Document Header -->
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom: 14pt;">
    <tr>
      <td>
        <h1>Utensil Theories</h1>
        <div class="category-banner">BOOK 2: EDUCATION & STUDY • NO. 2 OF 8 • $2</div>
      </td>
      <td align="right" valign="bottom">
        <span style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; font-size: 9pt; color: #64748B;">UTTP-BK2-2026 • PRINT READY</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p><strong>Description:</strong> Book 2 of the Utensil Theories Transfer Protocol. Feynman micro-study guides, math simplifiers, flashcard generators, and theoretical physics explainers.</p>

  <div class="cut-line">✂️ CUT CENTRAL SLIT LINE ALONG DOTTED LINE FOR 1-SHEET ZINE ASSEMBLY ✂️</div>

  <!-- 8-Page Imposition Table Grid (4 Cols x 2 Rows) -->
  <table class="zine-grid">
    <!-- ROW 1: Pages 8, 1, 4, 5 -->
    <tr>
      <!-- Page 8: Back Cover -->
      <td>
        <div class="page-tag">PAGE 8 • BACK COVER</div>
        <h3>Utensil Edu Back Cover</h3>
        <p>Utensil Theories Protocol #UTTP-BK2-2026. Education Edition.</p>
        <div class="prompt-box">Digital Flashcards: Scan QR</div>
      </td>

      <!-- Page 1: Front Cover -->
      <td class="cover-cell">
        <div style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; font-size: 8pt; color: #FDE68A;">NO. 2 OF 8 • $2</div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 14pt;">
          <div style="font-family: 'Georgia', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18pt; color: #FFFFFF;">Utensil Theories</div>
          <div style="font-size: 8pt; letter-spacing: 2pt; color: #FEF3C7;">EDUCATION & STUDY</div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 8pt; color: #FDE68A; text-align: center;">AI MADE EASY.</div>
      </td>

      <!-- Page 4: Math Simplifier -->
      <td>
        <div class="page-tag">PAGE 4 • MATH SIMPLIFIER</div>
        <h3>Math & Formula Simplifier</h3>
        <p>Turn confusing word problems into step-by-step algebra actions.</p>
        <div class="prompt-box">PROMPT: Solve math problem photo -> 3 plain language steps.</div>
      </td>

      <!-- Page 5: Flashcard Generator -->
      <td>
        <div class="page-tag">PAGE 5 • FLASHCARDS</div>
        <h3>Flashcard Generator</h3>
        <p>Create 5 study flashcards for any topic.</p>
        <div class="prompt-box">PROMPT: Generate 5 question & answer flashcards for [TOPIC].</div>
      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- ROW 2: Pages 7, 2, 3, 6 -->
    <tr>
      <!-- Page 7: Exam Anxiety Relief -->
      <td>
        <div class="page-tag">PAGE 7 • EXAM RELIEF</div>
        <h3>Exam Anxiety Relief</h3>
        <p>Quick 2-minute focus breathing technique.</p>
        <div class="prompt-box">PROMPT: Give 3 calming steps before taking an exam.</div>
      </td>

      <!-- Page 2: Antigravity Physics -->
      <td>
        <div class="page-tag">PAGE 2 • ANTIGRAVITY PHYSICS</div>
        <h3>Theoretical Physics & Antigravity</h3>
        <p>Understand levitation and physics using magnet analogies.</p>
        <div class="prompt-box">PROMPT: Explain levitation to 81yo using magnet analogies.</div>
      </td>

      <!-- Page 3: Feynman Micro-Study -->
      <td>
        <div class="page-tag">PAGE 3 • FEYNMAN METHOD</div>
        <h3>Feynman Micro-Study Sheet</h3>
        <p>Deconstruct any textbook chapter in 3 steps.</p>
        <div class="prompt-box">PROMPT: Teach [SUBJECT] using core idea + analogy.</div>
      </td>

      <!-- Page 6: Folding Guide -->
      <td>
        <div class="page-tag">PAGE 6 • FOLDING GUIDE</div>
        <h3>Visual Folding Guide</h3>
        <p>Fold paper in half twice. Cut central slit line. Pop open into booklet!</p>
        <div class="prompt-box">Diagram: 1-Sheet Zine Assembly</div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</div>
</body>
</html>
